    "confirmed": [
      "v70 misses initial loading at frame zero when native seeking never starts; v72 recovered both injected headers-only stalls within the original deadline.",
      "v70 has one active-scroll reload and misses repeated stalls; v72 physically recovered the four paired double-stall cases with at most two same-source reloads.",
